Z||000004||Ralph||09-03-2000||06:55 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by N_Man:<P>" And it did make noise like something was shaking on the inside. "<P>I believe you just hit the nail on the head. Anything loose on the inside of the cat is not good. Replace that with a hi flow cat and then, hang onto your hat.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/yellowformula/LittleFiero.jpg"> <BR>  <B>  Ralph </B>||||reg||1
